{"assertion_id": "ASSERT-PZZQ-001", "classic_source": "子平真诠", "evidence_id": "PZZQ-007-001", "quotation": "有格局必有高低...其理之大綱，亦在有情無情、有力無力之間", "namespace": "PZZQ.pattern_level", "domain": "格局", "type": "CONDITION", "required_state": ["pattern_state", "pattern_success"], "required_relation": ["有情/无情", "有力/无力"], "condition_positive": "格局成立", "condition_negative": "格局不成立则不论高低", "exception": "", "assertion_text": "格局高低由有情无情有力无力决定, 非成格即贵", "runtime_action": "SUPPORT_STATE", "confidence": "A", "audit_status": "ADMITTED"}
{"assertion_id": "ASSERT-PZZQ-002", "classic_source": "子平真诠", "evidence_id": "PZZQ-007-002", "quotation": "遂分成敗；而成敗之中...又有因成得敗、因敗得成之奇", "namespace": "PZZQ.pattern_success", "domain": "格局成败", "type": "CONDITION", "required_state": ["pattern_state"], "required_relation": ["因成得败/因败得成"], "condition_positive": "格成", "condition_negative": "成后带忌反败/败中反成", "exception": "", "assertion_text": "格局成败可因成得败/因败得成, 非一次性判定", "runtime_action": "CHANGE_RELATION", "confidence": "A", "audit_status": "ADMITTED"}
{"assertion_id": "ASSERT-PZZQ-003", "classic_source": "子平真诠", "evidence_id": "PZZQ-007-003", "quotation": "論命惟以月令用神為主，然亦須配氣候而互參之...凍水不生木...金水見之反為秀氣, 調候為急權而用之", "namespace": "PZZQ.pattern_success", "domain": "格局成败", "type": "RELATION", "required_state": ["pattern_state", "climate_state"], "required_relation": ["月令用神+气候互参"], "condition_positive": "月令用神得时", "condition_negative": "金寒水冷冻水不生木纵透官不贵", "exception": "调候急时可权用(如金水伤官喜见官)", "assertion_text": "格局成败须参气候寒暖, 调候急则权而用之(非改strength)", "runtime_action": "CHANGE_RELATION", "confidence": "A", "audit_status": "ADMITTED"}
{"assertion_id": "ASSERT-PZZQ-004", "classic_source": "子平真诠", "evidence_id": "PZZQ-007-004", "quotation": "凡全局之格，賴此一字而成者，均謂之相也...相神無破，貴格已成；相神有傷，立敗其格", "namespace": "PZZQ.xiangshen", "domain": "相神", "type": "STRUCTURE", "required_state": ["use_god_state"], "required_relation": ["辅佐用神成格"], "condition_positive": "有辅用神成格之字", "condition_negative": "伤用神甚于伤身, 伤相神立败格", "exception": "", "assertion_text": "相神=全局赖之以成格之字; 相神无伤则格成, 相神有伤立败格", "runtime_action": "SUPPORT_STATE", "confidence": "A", "audit_status": "ADMITTED"}
{"assertion_id": "ASSERT-PZZQ-005", "classic_source": "子平真诠", "evidence_id": "PZZQ-007-005", "quotation": "透干會支，取其清者用之，雜而不雜也...一透則一用，兼透則兼用，透而又會，則透與會並用。其合而有情者則為吉，其合而無情者則不吉", "namespace": "PZZQ.pattern", "domain": "杂气取格", "type": "CONDITION", "required_state": ["month_branch", "transparency"], "required_relation": ["透干/会支/有情无情"], "condition_positive": "辰戌丑未透干会支, 一透一用兼透并用, 合而有情", "condition_negative": "不透不会, 或合而无情(如财印两伤)", "exception": "有情卒无情/无情终有情需逐案看", "assertion_text": "杂气格在透干会支取清; 一透一用兼透并用; 合而有情吉无情不吉", "runtime_action": "SUPPORT_STATE", "confidence": "A", "audit_status": "ADMITTED"}
{"assertion_id": "ASSERT-PZZQ-006a", "classic_source": "子平真诠", "evidence_id": "PZZQ-007-006", "quotation": "至於財官為水，衝則反累...壬透為財，戊衝則劫動，何益之有", "namespace": "PZZQ.pattern", "domain": "杂气刑冲", "type": "LIMITATION", "required_state": ["month_branch", "use_element"], "required_relation": ["刑冲"], "condition_positive": "财官为土(戊己)冲则库启", "condition_negative": "财官为水(壬癸)逢冲反累, 不可冲", "exception": "", "assertion_text": "杂气刑冲分论: 财官为水逢冲反累, 非逢冲必发", "runtime_action": "CHANGE_RELATION", "confidence": "A", "audit_status": "ADMITTED"}
{"assertion_id": "ASSERT-PZZQ-006b", "classic_source": "子平真诠", "evidence_id": "PZZQ-007-006", "quotation": "故財官屬土，衝則庫啟...然終以戊己干頭為清，用干既透，即不衝而亦得也...四墓不忌刑衝，刑衝未必成格", "namespace": "PZZQ.pattern", "domain": "杂气刑冲", "type": "CONDITION", "required_state": ["month_branch", "use_element"], "required_relation": ["刑冲/透干"], "condition_positive": "财官属土冲则库启", "condition_negative": "用干既透即不冲亦得; 刑冲未必成格", "exception": "", "assertion_text": "财官属土冲则库启, 但终以戊己干透为清; 四墓不忌刑冲, 刑冲未必成格", "runtime_action": "CHANGE_RELATION", "confidence": "A", "audit_status": "ADMITTED"}
